("⚠ Middleware order affects typings and behavior (e.g. `devtools` outermost, per the docs' recommendations; verify).","Middleware order affects typings and behavior (the Zustand docs recommend `devtools` outermost; order was not exhaustively tested here). Verified for `persist`: with a synchronous storage (`createJSONStorage(() => localStorage)`-style) hydration ran synchronously during `create`, `persist.hasHydrated()` was already `true`, `migrate(persisted, version)` was called with the stored version, and `partialize` limited what was written."),
